  message: "Merged as PR #2263. The manifest carries the by-statement selector's left-out ids for its own files as '#- <id>' lines (DESELECTED_TESTS section, header '# By statement: ...'); Woodpecker's pytest step hands them to pytest_statement_deselect. Pre-merge e2e (equivalent edit in graph_select.mentions, BASE_BRANCH=HEAD smart-test --manifest): 101 files, 12 ids; the manifest's files run CI-style with the plugin: 2,573 passed, graph_select.py 100%, junit: 7 of test_graph_select.py's 19 tests ran. This PR's own manifest refused (scripts and .woodpecker changed). STILL OWED for the close: a src-only PR whose CI log shows the deselected count beside the file-level count."  # c05a
